  "title": "Keep the Beat",
  "kicker": "Lion dance",
  "blurb": "Drum, gong, cymbals. Three lanes, one pattern.",
  "mechanic": "beats",
  "fact": "The drum leads and the gong and cymbals answer. The pattern isn't decoration — three-star beats go with the lion investigating close by, seven-star with a long walk. The rhythm tells you what the lion is doing.",
